The '''temple chamber'''<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> was a chamber aboard the [[Imperial I-class Star Destroyer|''Imperial I''-class Star Destroyer]] ''[[Chimaera]]'', the [[flagship]] of [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]]. [[Galactic Emperor]] [[Darth Sidious|Palpatine]] ordered the portion of the [[Lothal Jedi Temple]] to be moved to the ''Chimaera'' stone by stone for [[Ezra Bridger]], in hopes that he would open the gateway and return to his [[Bridger family|parents]], bringing them back to life.<ref name="Family Reunion" />

